    "title": "GATEWAY_PROD_OAuth Token Generation API",
    "description": "The OAuth Token Generation API facilitates the secure issuance of access tokens needed for authenticated access to protected resources. This API is essential for developers implementing OAuth 2.0 authentication, enabling them to obtain tokens that allow their applications to securely interact with various services. Typical consumers include mobile and web application developers who require access to APIs on behalf of users. By issuing tokens through this endpoint, applications can ensure secure and authorized operations without compromising user credentials.",
